# Copy this file to ".env.local" (git ignores *.local) and fill it in. Restart `npm run dev` afterwards.
# DEMO ONLY: a VITE_ variable is baked into the page, so anyone who opens the site can read the key.
# Use a throwaway key from a free Groq account (no card on file) and revoke it after the demo.
# Or leave this empty: Heartly then asks you to paste a key, and keeps it only in this browser tab.
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults: llama-3.3-70b-versatile, with llama-3.1-8b-instant as the fallback when rate-limited.
# VITE_GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
